Derivation
----------
The Windows virtual-camera media source (windows/DllMain.cpp,
MediaSource.cpp/.h, MediaStream.cpp/.h, FrameServer.cpp/.h, Activator.h,
Logger.h, CatCamSource.def) and the initial shape of the Windows host
began as a fork of BestCam, the open-source reference implementation of
the Windows 11 Media Foundation virtual camera API
(MFCreateVirtualCamera), licensed under GPL v2.

The files were substantially modified for CatCam during 2026-07
(H.264/PCM TCP mux transport instead of MJPEG/HTTP, Media Foundation
decoder, Frame Server contract fixes, inline sample pacing, shared-memory
protocol changes, portrait/rotation pipeline, audio feed). Per GPL
section 2a, this file records that the derived files were changed and
when; per-file change headers are still to be added.

Third-party components (not included in this repository)
--------------------------------------------------------
- VB-Audio Virtual Cable (vb-audio.com): proprietary donationware used as
  the microphone endpoint. NOT bundled, NOT redistributed; the installer
  downloads it from the official site. Redistribution would require a
  commercial license from VB-Audio.
- Android Debug Bridge (adb): part of the Android SDK platform-tools,
  expected to be installed separately.
- The Android app depends on AndroidX/Jetpack libraries fetched by Gradle.
